# shadcn/ui look (Upside Lab)

Dark nova. Compact density. One accent (`primary` is near-white). Compose primitives. Do not restyle a component with extra colors.

## Tokens

`bg-background`, `bg-card`, `text-foreground`, `text-muted-foreground`, `bg-primary`, `border-border`, `ring-ring`. Cards use `rounded-xl ring-1 ring-foreground/10`, not gold borders. Nested surfaces are `bg-muted rounded-lg`, never a card in a card.

Money up/down is `text-gain` / `text-destructive`. Not a wash.

## Density

- Primary UI body text: `text-sm`. Captions, labels, and badges: `text-xs` `text-muted-foreground`.
- Controls are `h-8` / `rounded-lg`. Page gutter is `px-4`. Do not invent `p-5`, `p-panel`, or a tighter mobile pad.

## Primitives

Button (variants, no `btn-primary`). Input / Field / FieldGroup. Card header/content/footer. AlertDialog for confirm. Empty for empty. ToggleGroup for 2–7 choices. Badge not custom chips. Avatar with Fallback. Sonner toasts.

`gap-*` not `space-y-*`. `size-8` not `h-8 w-8`. `cn()` for conditionals. Icons in buttons: `data-icon`, no extra size class.
